<title>USA: Holographic, MTM Security reach agreement.</title>
<headline>Holographic, MTM Security reach agreement.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holographic Dimensions Inc said on Wednesday that it entered into an agreement to establish a vertically integrated security hologram manufacturing facility with MTM Security in Istanbul, Turkey.</p>
<p>Under the terms, MTM Security will purchase in excess of $500,000 in equipment from Holographic Dimensions.</p>
<p>The joint venture partners include the Turkish Government.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
